{
  "info": {
    "name": "LJVIS — Risk Scores",
    "_postman_id": "ljvis-risk-scores-v1",
    "description": "Functional tests for the risk-score module (LJVIS2-150/151/152, EU 2022/695): calculate/save/read via Ruuter.internal (recalculate/current, incl. ERRU riskBand mapping Kollane->Amber), admin list (auth/permission guard, filters, sorting, NULLS LAST), citizen endpoint auth-path validation. Fixtures seeded via DSL/Liquibase/test/20260827100001-risk-score-test-fixtures.sql (company_reg_code 90000001/02/03 = Punane/Nullpunkt/Valistatud) and 20260827100002-risk-score-kollane-fixture.sql (90000005 = Kollane/Amber, R=120). See docs/risk-score/formula.md and .ai/ljvis-tasks/LJVIS2-150/test-cases.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "[Auth] Login — Super Admin (risk_report.list)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{api_url}}/ljvis/auth/dev/dev-login",
          "host": [
            "{{api_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "ljvis",
            "auth",
            "dev",
            "dev-login"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\"personalCode\": \"{{pc_admin}}\"}"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Login returns 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "const token = typeof body === 'string' ? body : (body.response || body.token || '');",
              "pm.test('JWT token received', () => pm.expect(token).to.not.be.empty);",
              "pm.environment.set('cookie_admin', 'customJwtCookie=' + token);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
